X: 1
T: Ya Never Know
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The urchins' fortune-telling number from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody
N: (channel 0, track 5) of a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7934), key and octave as in
N: the source; chords fitted from the piano reduction (Am7-Dm7 doo-wop with Gm7
N: and F7). The pushing offbeat entries are straightened; pitches are the
N: source's. One pass: the rising "ya never know" hook twice, the held build and
N: the verse with its answer (source bars 33-55); the A naturals and E naturals
N: are written =A and =e over the C minor key.
